**Issue:** Silent error swallowing in the `safeParse` validation block. If validation fails, the error details are not logged, which makes debugging difficult.  
**Rule:** No silent error swallowing  
<details>  
<summary><b>Severity Level:</b> Warning ⚠️</summary>  

- ⚠️ Debugging validation issues becomes harder without logging the error details.  

</details>  

```suggestion  
if (!validated.success) {  
  console.error('Validation failed:', validated.error.flatten());  
  return NextResponse.json(  
    { error: 'Validation failed', details: validated.error.flatten() },  
    { status: 400 }  
  );  
}  
```  

